# `toolpath-cli` is excluded from the workspace and generates its own
# Cargo.lock when built directly. As a deprecated 3-line shim that's only
# built at release time, the lockfile carries no useful reproducibility
# signal beyond what path-cli's published version already pins.
crates/toolpath-cli/Cargo.lock
